## Docker

```bash
docker build -t {{ project_slug }}:latest --target prod .   # no uv, no sources, non-root
docker build -t {{ project_slug }}:dev --target dev .       # full toolchain

docker run --rm {{ project_slug }}:latest{% if use_cli %} hello Ada{% endif %}

docker run --rm -it -v "$PWD/tests:/app/tests:ro" {{ project_slug }}:dev
```

The build uses `uv sync --locked`: commit `uv.lock` after any dependency change.
