{% if use_data %}

## Data

Files under `data/` are tracked with **Git LFS** (rasters, NetCDF, HDF5,
JPEG 2000, Parquet, models…; see `.gitattributes`). The rest of the repository,
including documentation images, stays in plain Git.

```bash
git lfs install   # once per machine
git clone ...     # LFS files are fetched on clone
```

To track another format, add a `data/**/*.<ext>` rule to `.gitattributes`.
{% endif %}

